{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/73bfd8781cd9f1d75338c8ca19f6a358360865c6edbcc442b3d863fdf9e2be7462ff5e4d4122d9b0f47915f946ba68b8f45afe25a1b2c72beeaa9a47efbd0e42","height":600,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/S_cFY1shz9XVw7G0N_CRcWV84TMij9npZJSUs_orMJDaEp2q2dDULWfWGox_9PB5huMB40flftvnKbF6tHj_gcNHL6sJ46gAGyJ2Ojaw1OaZ8TTJElDQ","width":600},"name":"Julia Feldman","title":"Senior UX Researcher, Material Design"},"document_id":4757573890473984,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"},{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/d0c35cc07a1a84b3da6989484e42f9db5387e162afcf660a7cadcefdcd70a47100aa9f377e47d6ea042e08316e33bdfd7beb5ee523be9bb59e18e63a3991a855","height":600,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a99u00GMHFCsxvQqCC-dDhCem9te5huIDPiQv66j6GL5Ynop-e0nVrJiewnfDmjOVq2khQPdTsSAFKFr6HX4PFQlK8YU_M3NhnITmgDxRYBwrWE_K4s","width":600},"name":"Brenton Simpson","title":"Senior UX Engineer, Material Design"},"document_id":4679149532479488,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"},{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/7e5138eca810d4e687ef06641b8cebcc0fb8add57a4d21a8efb8c981fb86cd42b3f8b9cfaecf8bc2351f8e32f6fddacf4ef4ccc7b3201b66b1bad5cf3a2ba040","height":514,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/TgcPsmmVUrgPHfyQ3LEif6R-O10xl2daAXCD2Hm3CZh-zou245T8cxH2Ex5qoS9K226MYGMdfmSuHaItq0PGDS9WhkxmPn4qPulIAqbWi74zj9QWBw","width":514},"name":"Jonas Naimark","title":"Senior Motion Designer, Material Design"},"document_id":6197891441623040,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"},{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/5d60e753f0001fb83ad9d525e057a56f1bddb114a16ddc6e6c6e8a514eced94c2aae3c01fdfa05967760a77857a452a00b0c259e085842f56de155b00e6b5786","height":512,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-cVJ6qd7QoOFzT-KbBKJBEyvC4ODnzy2-oCK1rO3BH6vKea3i0F5Qudiy0dKSs61DEg0FsXTOhOLeSY80skXBZwV9OGTm-tjweMmmA","width":512},"name":"Michael Gilbert","title":"Staff UX Researcher, Material Design"},"document_id":5907552012075008,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p>想象一下，你正在手机上浏览餐厅菜单，点按了其中一道主菜。接下来会发生什么？是菜品的描述立即出现，还是你点按的<a href=\"https://material.io/components/cards\">卡片</a>以动画方式展开，呈现出更多细节？</p>\n<p>Material Research 想弄清楚这个问题。</p>\n<h2>研究</h2>\n<p>&lt;mio-video index=0&gt;&lt;/mio-video&gt;</p>\n<p>我们构建了一个点餐体验，并通过一项<a href=\"https://userresearch.google.com/\">研究</a>将其展示给一系列用户。参与者在点按浏览菜单时，会看到七种过渡动画之一，或者完全没有过渡动画（也称为<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jump_cut\">跳切</a>）。我们对这些参与者进行了访谈，以了解哪种过渡最适合卡片网格，以及原因何在。</p>\n<h2>研究结果</h2>\n<p>绝大多数参与者明确表示，他们更偏爱<a href=\"https://material.io/design/motion/the-motion-system.html#container-transform\">容器变换（container transform）</a>。容器变换是一种动效模式，通过将一个元素变换为另一个元素，在两个 UI 元素之间建立可见的联系，从而强化二者之间的关系。参与者给出了各种偏好它的理由，从过渡动画是否符合预期，到它唤起的情感，不一而足。下面我们来深入了解他们的一些想法。</p>\n<h4>参与者认为它完美契合场景</h4>\n<p>一些参与者表示，这种过渡让人感觉“契合”整个体验。卡片及其详情展示的是同一信息——在这里就是某一盘具体的菜品。让一个元素无缝变换为另一个，有助于用户建立对应用的心智模型，不至于迷失方向。事实上，一些参与者表示，感觉就像从未离开过当前页面一样。</p>\n<p>此外，一些参与者告诉我们，容器变换唤起了拿起东西仔细端详，或是把菜单拉近细看的感觉。Material 试图借助用户对物理世界的熟悉感，让数字世界更易于驾驭。参与者在将他们与数字原型的交互和翻阅真实菜单进行对比时，注意到了这一点。更进一步说，它不仅让人联想到餐厅，对某些参与者而言，还让他们感觉自己正在一家高档餐厅受到悉心款待——这也引出了下一个偏好的理由。</p>\n<h4>参与者喜欢这种过渡为体验增添的感受</h4>\n<p>对于容器变换过渡，许多参与者告诉我们，它给人的感觉温暖而有吸引力，甚至称得上温馨惬意！只有容器变换过渡被参与者认为传递了积极情绪，并且显得高端——正如上文提到的，参与者说它让人感觉置身于高档餐厅。相比之下，少数偏爱<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jump_cut\">跳切</a>或<a href=\"https://material.io/design/motion/the-motion-system.html#transition-patterns\">淡入淡出（fade through）</a>过渡的参与者，则称这些过渡“高效”和“快捷”。但值得注意的是，从来没有人因为这些过渡能提升体验感受而偏爱它们，而且对大多数人来说，它们让人感到压迫和不适。</p>\n<h2>结论</h2>\n<p>Material You 致力于拥抱情感与表现力。我们的研究结果表明，像容器变换这样简单的元素——两个页面之间的动画过渡——也可以成为让体验“恰到好处”的重要一环。它甚至能够激发观看者积极的情绪反应。</p>\n<p>正如我们在 Material 团队常说的：“设计永无止境。”我们总有更多工作要做，更多洞察有待发掘。没有哪种过渡能适用于所有场景；不过，如果你想让用户在浏览一系列信息时获得无缝、高级的体验，不妨试试容器变换。你可以查看 <a href=\"https://material.io/design/motion/the-motion-system.html#container-transform\">material.io 上的动效指南</a>，了解更多细节，并开始在自己的产品中加入动效。</p>","image":[],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[{"a11y_description":"a series of 9 animated transitions","autoplay":true,"bordered":true,"caption":"A variety of transitions tested in the Basil Material study app","case":null,"file":{"file_name":"Basil_-_Line_up.mp4","file_path":"9155ea019c8996a54129615a9cc9bbfcc496da455d757ad8a67cbdb4cbecfb314bedf19164360d0d97384d291a8e0af4fb0f9f6fc4f593c1fbb31ed51944c965","url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/material-io-design/m2/assets/downloads/9155ea019c8996a54129615a9cc9bbfcc496da455d757ad8a67cbdb4cbecfb314bedf19164360d0d97384d291a8e0af4fb0f9f6fc4f593c1fbb31ed51944c965.mp4"},"hide_controls":false,"loop":true,"muted":true,"silent":true}]}],"category":"2022","hero":{"a11y_description":"container transform animation","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/d09bd01686aa0a319158364312b46274edd8330770118f9a1707596bbc05be1c465bf9d197f9c55ce2abcd75641a300b7ed1954835091c6c11353c03e14c67dc","height":750,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/h-AzVFy6YUsxqT83bikUXRQjBwVSDTb_bBTYEiwl_PKBXh3RqZ5peG5rjIVVYuHUfY9aiHO9nbE15rxhZHFXyOFbJfLHovKcO2pn7K-Eqi_r1h7AM5c","width":1200}},"hero_card":false,"metadata":{"keywords":"research motion","meta_robots":" ","schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"用动画过渡让界面显得“精致讲究”","share_image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/c205a58901a0f54034822fb59fff67e2fee7a512feefa5098007937c65048f94966c89cb1fcbea47332320d244e84f3a6ea777607d2d626ddf91bac60ed554ca","height":500,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/tYq6jGC4ux8-lTwFolxyAaOMsAa9_z2pbGEhpq36kmWSiDg3HhBJoeEv4nELB